        "TileImage": "$($repository de0d2376-2887-4eeb-a5fb-e48d21ee04ae).Image",
        "Description": "After the dissolvement of the security company in England, the German drug trade has gone wild and free, where the drug-virus from Miami is now being sold in rave parties in Berlin. We have 10-11 agents in the area with the antidote for the afflicted, but we must eliminate the head of the serpent, Rolf Hirschmuller, and then his two dealers and supplier. Rolf had clear-cut connections to Florida Man and the drug-virus was not accidental, nor the contract in Dartmoor.\rGood luck 47.\r\rShkerrrr-",
